[background arg="res://sprites/24062026133858-0001 (1).jpg" fade="0.0"]
join chocolatecake left
audio music "res://Soundtracks/Raspusia_song.mp3"

chocolatecake: How’s it going?
character: Hey! I'm… pretty alright.
chocolatecake: Are you sure?
character: Uh… Yeah?
chocolatecake: Just looking out for ya! That’s all.
character: …Alright?
chocolatecake: What do you want to do?
character: Why are we rushing? You still haven’t even introduced yourself yet.
chocolatecake: Oh! Apologies, I was lost in the moment..
character: [i]What moment? The moment just began.
chocolatecake: So, what do you want to do?
character: I still don’t know who you are.
chocolatecake: Right!
chocolatecake: Charlotte Blackout, pleased to meet you.
character: Blackout. Makes sense, given the cake. I’m {ChefName}.
chocolatecake: So… what do you want to do now then?
character: I’m not really sure. What’s your shtick? The other people had something about them, something… special? I don’t know.
chocolatecake: I really like mana, magic, and wizards.
character: [i]Huh. I never actually really thought about that, I just kind of… accepted it.
chocolatecake: So how are you doing today?
character: I’m… honestly doing fine. You’ve asked that already, by the way.
chocolatecake: Oh!
character: Yeah. So… about mana, and magic, and all that. Can I… y’know, get some pointers?
chocolatecake: Uh...
character: 'Uh’?
chocolatecake: I… Not yet?
character: Why not?
chocolatecake: Because I wanna get to know you more before I waste all my time talking about magic.
character: That’s… pretty fair, I guess. You’re on a time limit, after all.
chocolatecake: Yeah. Thanks.
character: Uh-huh. So… Let’s get to it?
chocolatecake: Right! Uh… show me around?
character: I… There’s really not much more to it than this.
[wait time="1.0"]
You walked around the table once, silent and motioning to the various appliances.
chocolatecake: ...Ah.
character: Honestly, I don’t know. The only thing I can think of is stuff I’ve already done.
chocolatecake: …How about I talk about mana and magic stuff?
- Gracefully decline
	character: No, that’s… this is supposed to be a date. It’s fine.
	chocolatecake: I guess… What makes it super romantic?
	character: Ah-hah! We can go on an actual date!
	jump cakeDATE/
	set {CakeRoute} = "Date"
- The super fleshed out lore the writer spent ages on
	character: …Please. I want to understand this.
	jump cakeLORE/
	set {CakeRoute} = "Lore"
- I have an idea…
	character: No, it’s… it’s fine. Actually, here’s an idea.
	chocolatecake: Oh yea?
	character: I got a few games on this old Minrendo Shift. Maybe we could give one a shot?
	set {CakeRoute} = "Gaming"
	jump cakeGAMING/
